  "blocks": [
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        34.98200225830078,
        393.17059326171875,
        51.63800048828125
      ],
      "text": "Làm đềtrực tuyến tại: https://ielts-fighter.com/online-test.html\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        59.94099426269531,
        302.55078125,
        76.59700012207031
      ],
      "text": "Website tựhọc IELTS: https://ielts-fighter.com\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        84.99369812011719,
        233.57534790039062,
        103.79259490966797
      ],
      "text": "show misses a performance.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        104.793701171875,
        511.8205871582031,
        222.95361328125
      ],
      "text": "We should definitely include that information about early audiences in our\nproject. I also think it’s important to mention that lots of ordinary people at\nthat time were illiterate, so theatre programmes were of limited value in\nadvertising plays. When a company of actors arrived in a town, they’d parade\naround the streets in their costumes, beating drums and announcing their\nupcoming performances.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        235.89205932617188,
        104.5427017211914,
        255.39346313476562
      ],
      "text": "FINN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        75.12000274658203,
        255.8747100830078,
        404.0980529785156,
        274.6736145019531
      ],
      "text": "Interesting. I couldn’t imagine that happening now either.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        287.6110534667969,
        112.34269714355469,
        307.1124572753906
      ],
      "text": "MAYA:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        307.59368896484375,
        481.25537109375,
        346.3135986328125
      ],
      "text": "There’s also an interesting comparison to make between 18th and 19th\ncentury programmes.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        359.2520446777344,
        104.5427017211914,
        378.7534484863281
      ],
      "text": "FINN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        379.23468017578125,
        501.49957275390625,
        417.8336181640625
      ],
      "text": "Wasn’t it in the 19th century that theatre programmes started to resemble\nprograms today?\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        430.77203369140625,
        112.34269714355469,
        450.2734375
      ],
      "text": "MAYA:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        75.12000274658203,
        450.87469482421875,
        486.65863037109375,
        469.6736145019531
      ],
      "text": "Yes and unlike programs from the 18th century they always used colour.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        482.4920349121094,
        104.5427017211914,
        501.9934387207031
      ],
      "text": "FINN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        502.5936584472656,
        522.49560546875,
        561.1135864257812
      ],
      "text": "And there was a greater variety of designs. But personally I think 18th century\nprogrammes were superior because they told the theatregoers so many things,\nincluding about the actors.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        574.0520629882812,
        112.34269714355469,
        593.553466796875
      ],
      "text": "MAYA:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        75.12000274658203,
        594.0347290039062,
        468.4189147949219,
        612.8336181640625
      ],
      "text": "And about the writer, the plot and sometimes the history of the play.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        625.6520385742188,
        104.5427017211914,
        645.1534423828125
      ],
      "text": "FINN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        645.7537231445312,
        483.6553649902344,
        684.4736328125
      ],
      "text": "That’s right. What should we say about theatre programmes in the 20th\ncentury?\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        697.2920532226562,
        112.34269714355469,
        716.79345703125
      ],
      "text": "MAYA:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        717.3937377929688,
        494.2889709472656,
        755.9926147460938
      ],
      "text": "I reckon the most important thing is the dramatic change they underwent\nduring World War II.\n"
    }
  ]
}